@startuml
title Local Developer Workflow
hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}

actor Developer
participant "Backend CLI" as CLI
participant "Analysis and\nScoring Layer" as Backend
participant "GitHub and External\nMetadata Sources" as Sources
database "Report Directory" as Reports
participant "React Web\nApplication" as Frontend
participant "Cytoscape.js" as Cytoscape

Developer -> CLI: analyze target: owner/repository [optional ref]
activate CLI
CLI -> Backend: analyze(target, ref, output directory)
activate Backend
Backend -> Sources: fetch manifests, source snapshot,\nand package metadata
Sources --> Backend: repository and package evidence
Backend -> Backend: extract graph and run detectors
Backend -> Backend: enrich findings and calculate SSSS
Backend -> Reports: write analysis-results.json
Backend -> Reports: write analysis-report.md
Reports --> Backend: output paths
Backend --> CLI: summary, warnings, and output paths
deactivate Backend
CLI --> Developer: print execution result
deactivate CLI

Developer -> Frontend: open local application
Developer -> Frontend: choose analysis-results.json
Frontend -> Frontend: validate and map the JSON contract
Frontend -> Cytoscape: render projected graph
Cytoscape --> Frontend: node selection events
Frontend --> Developer: filters, summary, graph,\nand dependency details
@enduml
